  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1103.02 Equipment Installation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1103.02 Equipment Installation. The installation and use of manufactured equipment at a facility shall conform to the manufacturer’s specifications and recommendations, unless the permittee provides a written statement bearing the signature and seal of a qualified professional engineer certifying that the non-conforming installation and use will not adversely affect the environment, public health or safety.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1100); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2803.02); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14108, eff 11-13-24, EXPIRES: 11-13-34",
